Package: rquaidsce
Type: Package
Title: Censored Quadratic Almost Ideal Demand System (QUAIDS) Estimation
Version: 1.5.0
Author: Sina Amiri [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Sina Amiri <sinaamiri9000@gmail.com>
Authors@R: person("Sina", "Amiri", email = "sinaamiri9000@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: High-performance estimation of Censored Quadratic Almost Ideal Demand Systems (QUAIDS)
    with Ray (1983) demographic scaling and Shonkwiler-Yen (1999) two-step censoring correction,
    powered by the 'pyquaidsce' backend via 'reticulate'. Supports Iterated Feasible Generalized
    Nonlinear Least Squares (IFGNLS), custom selection equations, internal IV expenditure control functions,
    and fast multi-core bootstrap standard errors.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    reticulate (>= 1.28),
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/sinaamiri9000-collab/pyquaidsce
BugReports: https://github.com/sinaamiri9000-collab/pyquaidsce/issues
